{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19106","headline":"闻韩宾擢第归觐以诗美之兼贺韩十五曹长时韩牧永州 · 刘禹锡","name":"闻韩宾擢第归觐以诗美之兼贺韩十五曹长时韩牧永州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"零陵香草满郊垧，丹穴雏飞入翠屏。\n孝若归来成画赞，孟阳别後有山铭。\n兰陔旧地花才结，桂树新枝色更青。\n爲报儒林丈人道，如今从此鬓星星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}